    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.04.01",
    "parent": {
      "kind": "core-rule",
      "id": "fight-step"
    },
    "summary": "In the fight sequence, a player due to pick a unit to fight may pass the choice back to their opponent if each of their units still **eligible to fight** is over 5\" away from every enemy unit.\n\nThe Fight step ends when both players pass in turn, or when one passes while the other has no eligible units left.",
